        {
          "text": "Kutangalwa Hekalu iseagho sena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wamaiza wa wandu wa Juda na Benjamini weresikireghe angu wandu wiwurie kufuma wubarishonyi werekoghe wikiagha Hekalu ya BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikamchea Zerubabeli na wabaa wa kichuku chawo wikawizera, “Ndediaghe Hekalu diwose; angu dadamtasa Mlungu onyu seji koni mumtasagha, nesi dadamfunyira vizongona kwake toe kufuma ngelo ra Esarhadoni mzuri wa Ashuri uo orediredieghe aha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.24+2KI.17.25+2KI.17.26+2KI.17.27+2KI.17.28+2KI.17.29+2KI.17.30+2KI.17.31+2KI.17.32+2KI.17.33+2KI.17.34+2KI.17.35+2KI.17.36+2KI.17.37+2KI.17.38+2KI.17.39+2KI.17.40+2KI.17.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Waz. 17.24-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Zerubabeli, Jeshua na wabaa wa vichuku Israeli wikawizera, “Ndedine haja ya wutesia ghonyu ghoagha Hekalu ya Mlungu odu; dichaiagha diweni sa iji koni Koreshi mzuri wa Pashia oredilaghirieghe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wandu werekoghe wikakaia isangenyi wikawoka kuwibwagha ngolo wayahudi na kuwibonya wiobuo kuagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikawihonga wabaa wa Serikali ya Pashia eri wibonye chia etangala wandu wa Juda wisekatishe mpango ghwawo matuku gha Koreshi mzuri wa Pashia, hata kuvikia ngelo ra Dario mzuri wa Pashia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutangalwa Jerusalemu iseagho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji Ahasuero orezoeghe kubonya nguma, wamaiza wa wandu werekoghe wikikaia Juda na Jerusalemu wereandikieghe barua ya mashitakio aighu ya wandu wa Juda na Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est. 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku gha kubonya nguma kwa Mzuri Artashasta wa Pashia, Bishilani, Mithredathi, Tabeeli, na wambao wikaandika barua kwa mzuri Artashasta kwa kiteto cha kiarami; ikakaia ifasirilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni Rehumu m'baa wa isanga, na Shimshai mwandiki wa isanga, niwo wereandikieghe barua kwa mzuri Artashasta aighu ya Jerusalemu seji inughagha: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Barua kufuma kwa Rehumu m'baa wa isanga, na kufuma kwa Shimshai mwandiki, na wambao watanyi, watini wa m'baa wa isanga, wabaa wa kazi wa Kipashia, wandu wa Ereki, Wababuloni, wandu wa Susa, nawo ni Waelami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na wandu wazima wa iyo mbari erebarishiroghe ni Ashurbanipali mundu m'baa wa ishima, ikaghenjwa na kuwikwa mizinyi ya Samaria na andu kuzima isangenyi jiko magharibi ya Moda ghwa Eufrate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ihi niyo kopi ya barua wereidumieghe: “Kwa mzuri Artashasta, kufuma kwa wadumiki wako wandu wiko isanga ja magharibi ya Moda ghwa Eufrate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dakunde kumanye ee mzuri kukaia waja Wayahudi werefumieghe kwako, wikacha kodu waendie Jerusalemu, nawo waawuyaagha ghuja muzi mmbiwi ghuleghaa malagho. Waawuyaagha wurigha na kuboisa msingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo kumanye ee mzuri kukaia muzi ughu ghukaaghwa, na wurigha ghwaro ghusie, wandu awa ndewichaalipa kodi na wushuru, na pesa ra wuzuri richaapungua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana kwa kukaia daawuyakaia aisi ya nguma ya mzuri, ndeifwanagha isi diwone mzuri ukisowelwa ishima, niko daduma dikumanyishe ee mzuri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri kufunye momu malagho ghizighano agho ghiandikilo ni weke ndeyo vuonyi. Kukabonya huwo, kuchamanya kukaia muzi ughu ndeghorekoghe ghosikira, na seji ghusumbue wazuri na wabonyi nguma wa masanga wengi kufuma kala; kwakurie sena kuwibonyera wandu wose nguma. Iyo niyo shekeria ya muzi ughu kutoteshwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isi deko na wuloli ee mzuri kukaia muzi ughu ghukawuya ghukaaghwa, na wurigha ghwaro ghumerelo, ndekuwuyaakaia na ndighi rebonya nguma isangenyi magharibi ya Moda ghwa Eufrate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao mzuri ukaduma matumbulio ghinughagha: “Kwa Rehumu m'baa wa isanga na Shimshai mwandiki, na wambao wikaiagha Samaria na andu kuzima isangenyi ja magharibi ya Moda ghwa Eufrate, namroghua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Barua muniredie yashomelo worinyi imbiri kwapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nabonyere itangazo, malagho ghikalawulwa vuonyi na kuwoneka kukaia kufuma kala ugho muzi ghwadalwa na wazuri, na kubonya sheshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazuri wiwadie ndighi werekoghe wikibonya nguma aho na isangenyi jose ja magharibi ya Moda ghwa Eufrate; wikakaia wikiwada kodi, wushuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo mtangaze kukaia awa wandu wighirilo kubonya iyo kazi, hata nabonya itangazo izima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lindia kusebonye iji ilagho mboa; kwaki maza ridimagha kuzama hata mzuri ungie ndengonyi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
